    "interpretation": "The video highlights 'confirm shaming' as a dark pattern leveraged through psychological principles like the 'Computers as Social Actors' paradigm and cognitive dissonance. The creator argues that while it might push short-term conversions, it damages long-term brand equity due to psychological reactance.",
